  "description": "That song… It sounds like my brother’s unreleased track! Just before his untimely death, Su-In’s beloved older brother recorded an album dedicated to him – a final gift that was soon forgotten in a desk drawer. Years later, Su-In hears one of those tracks on TV, and it’s being claimed by his brother’s former bandmate. Now, Su-In must take the stage, beat the competition, and take back his brother’s songs… all through music.\n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)",
